Z||000003||Tim||11-17-1999||06:02 PM||||Got mine a few years ago, a lot of info.  Doesn't tell you everything, but every Fiero V6 owner should have it in their libary.  The book is writen towards the first time rebuilder.  If you would never think of tearing an engine down, then read this and see why you shouldn't.  A lot of pictures to give you a inside look at the V6. You better know more than what the book tells to re-build an engine.  I enjoyed the book.||||reg||1
